{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005c","title":"刘备鞭督邮弃官","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005c-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"正文记刘备求见督邮不得，缚而杖二百，解绶系其颈，随后弃官亡命。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005c-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p005-dianlue","label":"《典略》","text":"《典略》称督邮将遣刘备，刘备以密教为辞绑走督邮，杖百余下，因其求哀而放走；与正文的杖数和细节分列。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p005-dianlue"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"杖督邮弃官","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"安熹","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005c-q"]},"time":{"label":"任安熹尉后","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005c-q"],"after":"xianzhu-e-o005b"},"source_order":[32,20,"O005c"],"order":6498},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005b","title":"刘备从邹靖讨黄巾并任安熹尉","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"黄巾起事后，刘备率属众随邹靖征讨，有功而任安熹尉。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"从军任官","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0015","role":"领军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"安熹","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q"]},"time":{"year":184,"label":"灵帝末黄巾起","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y184","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o005","basis":"灵帝末黄巾起"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o005b-q","xianzhu-q-o005","wudi-q-o004","wudi-q-b-0b46b06245df0636b76c"]},"source_order":[32,20,"O005b"],"order":6497}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o005c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8d72564c7b9f62ba311c","layer":"original","quote":"督邮以公事到县，先主求谒，不通；直入缚督邮，杖二百；解绶系其颈着马枊〖5〗，﹝二﹞弃官亡命。﹝三﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":99,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p005-dianlue","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-a9574fbf5901a7bff912","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《典略》曰：“其后州郡被诏书：其有军功为长吏者，当沙汰之。备疑在遣中。督邮至县，当遣备。备素知之，闻督邮在传舍，备欲求见督邮；督邮称疾，不肯见备。备恨之，因还治，将吏卒更诣传舍；突入门，言：‘我被府君密教，收督邮！’遂就床缚之，将出到界。自解其绶，以系督邮颈；缚之著树，鞭杖百余下，欲杀之。督邮求哀，乃释去之。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2088e642d959ff4573e8","start":0,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
